# Legacy Cursor rules entrypoint

Prefer project rules under `.cursor/rules/` (especially `code-quality-standards.mdc`, always applied).

Canonical quality standards: `.agents/rules/code-quality-standards.md`
Cross-tool agent entry: `AGENTS.md`

While coding, enforce the 6 pillars (Architecture, Security/OWASP, Performance, Testing, Documentation, Accessibility). Do not defer quality checks only to PR review or 「마무리」.
